Hand back: verdict `merge` (nothing medium or worse) or `fix`; numbered findings with severity (blocker, high,
medium, low), file and line, how to reproduce; the checks with counts; the report's path. At most 30 lines.

Rules: never `pkill` or `pgrep -f`; kill only by PID; never git stash, reset --hard, rebase, amend, force-push or
